(6133652, 903878, 71239, '<td valign="top">Clean and simple, really strong pattern shot and an unusual subject.  Great shot and 10.</td>', 'Clean and simple, really strong pattern shot and an unusual subject.  Great shot and 10.', '2010-08-18 05:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6133656, 903160, 71239, '<td valign="top">Lovely techincals with a tightly controlled exposure.  A classic view taken at just the right time with the foreground and sky nicely neutral allowing maximum impact from the pyramid and surrounding galleries.  Top job (9) and strong ribbon candidate.</td>', 'Lovely techincals with a tightly controlled exposure.  A classic view taken at just the right time with the foreground and sky nicely neutral allowing maximum impact from the pyramid and surrounding galleries.  Top job (9) and strong ribbon candidate.', '2010-08-18 05:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6133658, 904071, 71239, '<td valign="top">I really like the odd perspective of this shot - it took me a while to work out what I was looking at.  Plus marks for creativity in spotting this view and turning it into a minimalist shot with strong lines and central subject. (8)</td>', 'I really like the odd perspective of this shot - it took me a while to work out what I was looking at.  Plus marks for creativity in spotting this view and turning it into a minimalist shot with strong lines and central subject. (8)', '2010-08-18 05:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6133661, 903438, 119792, '<td valign="top">A lovely photo - and I know that church!<br/> <br/>I would have trimmed the photo a little on both sides to increase the feeling of eternety...</td>', 'A lovely photo - and I know that church! I would have trimmed the photo a little on both sides to increase the feeling of eternety...', '2010-08-18 05:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6133662, 903894, 71239, '<td valign="top">This shot demonstrates how a small element can completely alter the story you get from a shot.  All the impact is from having the single truck correctly placed on the span and says to me "been a long journey, still some way to go but the end is in sight".  Great capture.</td>', 'This shot demonstrates how a small element can completely alter the story you get from a shot.  All the impact is from having the single truck correctly placed on the span and says to me "been a long journey, still some way to go but the end is in sight".  Great capture.', '2010-08-18 05:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6133663, 904131, 119792, '<td valign="top">Fantastic composition!</td>', 'Fantastic composition!', '2010-08-18 05:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6133664, 904007, 119792, '<td valign="top">Crisp and amazing colors!<br/>Great composition.</td>', 'Crisp and amazing colors!Great composition.', '2010-08-18 05:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6133665, 904058, 71239, '<td valign="top">Nice to see a simple, highish key pattern shot in this challenge.  Nice diffuse lighting has removed any distracting shadows and left a gentle feel to the shot.  Great work.</td>', 'Nice to see a simple, highish key pattern shot in this challenge.  Nice diffuse lighting has removed any distracting shadows and left a gentle feel to the shot.  Great work.', '2010-08-18 05:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6133666, 903307, 119792, '<td valign="top">Really catches the spirit of great architecture!</td>', 'Really catches the spirit of great architecture!', '2010-08-18 05:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6133667, 904070, 71239, '<td valign="top">Stunning building and nicely handled exposure.  Curious to know why you left the image tilted anticlockwise with so many strong vertical and horizontal elements present.</td>', 'Stunning building and nicely handled exposure.  Curious to know why you left the image tilted anticlockwise with so many strong vertical and horizontal elements present.', '2010-08-18 05:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6133668, 903424, 71239, '<td valign="top">Interesting architecture, but shooting it from the shadow side with a bright sky is always going to cause problems (I accept that the sun may not come around to this side of the building at this time of year - that would indicate that unfortunately getting better lighting on this shot just isn''t possible at the moment).  There is also a strong white halo around the building which is a bit distracting, possibly from local contrast enhancement being applied a little too strongly?<br/> <br/>Hope this shot does OK for you.</td>', 'Interesting architecture, but shooting it from the shadow side with a bright sky is always going to cause problems (I accept that the sun may not come around to this side of the building at this time of year - that would indicate that unfortunately getting better lighting on this shot just isn''t possible at the moment).  There is also a strong white halo around the building which is a bit distracting, possibly from local contrast enhancement being applied a little too strongly? Hope this shot does OK for you.', '2010-08-18 05:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6133671, 903954, 71239, '<td valign="top">The house has good potential as a subject, but you''ve been unlucky to have a very overcast sky on the day you took this.  As a result the scene is very flatly lit which doesn''t show off the orange as well as it could.  Perhaps shooting a detail of the house against a bright blue sky would give good strong colours and more of a pattern image?<br/> <br/>Hope this shot does OK for you.</td>', 'The house has good potential as a subject, but you''ve been unlucky to have a very overcast sky on the day you took this.  As a result the scene is very flatly lit which doesn''t show off the orange as well as it could.  Perhaps shooting a detail of the house against a bright blue sky would give good strong colours and more of a pattern image? Hope this shot does OK for you.', '2010-08-18 06:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6133674, 904093, 71239, '<td valign="top">Unusual to only include one of the towers in a shot of Tower Bridge and making the tower central.  For me, I find my eye is pulled out of the frame first left by the suspension lines and then right by the ''floating'' beam at the top.  It also looks like you''ve cropped in a lot as the detail in the stonework is soft or pixelated.<br/> <br/>If possible it might have been better to cross over to the South Bank where you can get a range of angles on the bridge as well as less clutter in the background.<br/> <br/>Sorry - I hope this shot does OK for you.</td>', 'Unusual to only include one of the towers in a shot of Tower Bridge and making the tower central.  For me, I find my eye is pulled out of the frame first left by the suspension lines and then right by the ''floating'' beam at the top.  It also looks like you''ve cropped in a lot as the detail in the stonework is soft or pixelated. If possible it might have been better to cross over to the South Bank where you can get a range of angles on the bridge as well as less clutter in the background. Sorry - I hope this shot does OK for you.', '2010-08-18 06:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6133676, 903619, 71239, '<td valign="top">Definitely a different perspective :-) however a bright sky and the front of the building in shadow is always going to make life difficult as it makes the eye drift out to the sky and not stay on the main subject.<br/> <br/>Sorry - hope this shot does OK for you.</td>', 'Definitely a different perspective :-) however a bright sky and the front of the building in shadow is always going to make life difficult as it makes the eye drift out to the sky and not stay on the main subject. Sorry - hope this shot does OK for you.', '2010-08-18 06:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
