(6135410, 903307, 116354, '<td valign="top">You''ve found great location and fantastic light. However, I find the composition is on a weak side. My eye is missing geometrical precision here, which would have made it way stronger.</td>', 'You''ve found great location and fantastic light. However, I find the composition is on a weak side. My eye is missing geometrical precision here, which would have made it way stronger.', '2010-08-19 16:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6135414, 903948, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is by far one of the more intriguingly tactile images I''ve seen of the Disney. The colors are to die for, it''s beautifully rendered. It''s actually my top pick in what, for me, is a very weak challenge.<br/> <br/>That said, I''m a little put off by the title, and here''s why: in the Judeo-Christian cultural tradition, Jerusalem''s "Western Wall" (aka the "Wailing Wall") is one of the holiest sites in the world. To the extent that this title calls up allusions to the Jerusalem wall, it''s a little perturbing, and I can only assume you wouldn''t want those allusions to be there.<br/> <br/>Very likely I''m the only one that feels this way, though, and in any case it doesn''t affect my scoring, it''s just an observation.</td>', 'This is by far one of the more intriguingly tactile images I''ve seen of the Disney. The colors are to die for, it''s beautifully rendered. It''s actually my top pick in what, for me, is a very weak challenge. That said, I''m a little put off by the title, and here''s why: in the Judeo-Christian cultural tradition, Jerusalem''s "Western Wall" (aka the "Wailing Wall") is one of the holiest sites in the world. To the extent that this title calls up allusions to the Jerusalem wall, it''s a little perturbing, and I can only assume you wouldn''t want those allusions to be there. Very likely I''m the only one that feels this way, though, and in any case it doesn''t affect my scoring, it''s just an observation.', '2010-08-19 16:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6135417, 903449, 100002, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. Keeps me looking and looking...</td>', 'This is a great shot. Keeps me looking and looking...', '2010-08-19 16:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6135421, 904007, 100002, '<td valign="top">Singapore! I`ve just bin there and took quite some pictures! But this is awsome. You found the right spot for that shot! This is one of my favorites!</td>', 'Singapore! I`ve just bin there and took quite some pictures! But this is awsome. You found the right spot for that shot! This is one of my favorites!', '2010-08-19 16:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
