(6136187, 903878, 24962, '<td valign="top">I like this, it appeals to my sense of humour:) The person who numbered these seats obviously used his fingers and toes, added one, then went back down to one:) Nice capture, great perspective. Well Done</td>', 'I like this, it appeals to my sense of humour:) The person who numbered these seats obviously used his fingers and toes, added one, then went back down to one:) Nice capture, great perspective. Well Done', '2010-08-20 16:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
