(6136475, 903138, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure and night shot.  I walk by it on my way to work.  You captured this nicely with the Keller Fountain in the foreground and the Portland Plaza (high rise) nicely framed by the trees.  Nice job. <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Portland_Plaza" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">A Wiki link</a></td>', 'Nice exposure and night shot.  I walk by it on my way to work.  You captured this nicely with the Keller Fountain in the foreground and the Portland Plaza (high rise) nicely framed by the trees.  Nice job. A Wiki link', '2010-08-21 01:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6136478, 903878, 103032, '<td valign="top">Different take.  Like the symmetry and patterns.  Hope this does well for you.</td>', 'Different take.  Like the symmetry and patterns.  Hope this does well for you.', '2010-08-21 01:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6136484, 903468, 103032, '<td valign="top">Perspective is great.  Your title really captures the feeling when looking at this.  I think your composition with the circle structure in the center surrounded by the skyscrapers pulls this together to be an interesting image. So is the building in the center of the circle really curved? or are my eyes playing tricks on me?  Nice shot, my top pick.</td>', 'Perspective is great.  Your title really captures the feeling when looking at this.  I think your composition with the circle structure in the center surrounded by the skyscrapers pulls this together to be an interesting image. So is the building in the center of the circle really curved? or are my eyes playing tricks on me?  Nice shot, my top pick.', '2010-08-21 01:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6136486, 904069, 103032, '<td valign="top">Love the symmetry and the illusion of the reflection.  Pretty tricky on the eyes.  Cool pic.</td>', 'Love the symmetry and the illusion of the reflection.  Pretty tricky on the eyes.  Cool pic.', '2010-08-21 01:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
