(6136884, 903878, 115814, '<td valign="top">Very nice. An effective combination of symmetry, line and color. Wouldn''t have though seating would work so well for this theme, but it does. Your title is the coup d'' gras. Hope you do well.</td>', 'Very nice. An effective combination of symmetry, line and color. Wouldn''t have though seating would work so well for this theme, but it does. Your title is the coup d'' gras. Hope you do well.', '2010-08-21 14:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
