(6136886, 904070, 115814, '<td valign="top">This one is puzzling for me. When I first see it (each time) it seems like it''s going to be too busy. Yet it draws me in and the patterns seem to synthesize into a  congruent whole. Not sure, but the concentric rings of light seem to tie it all together.</td>', 'This one is puzzling for me. When I first see it (each time) it seems like it''s going to be too busy. Yet it draws me in and the patterns seem to synthesize into a  congruent whole. Not sure, but the concentric rings of light seem to tie it all together.', '2010-08-21 14:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6136887, 904091, 115814, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the diffusion created at the bottom from the widening shafts of light. I''m wondering if there might be a way to increase some contrast overall without losing the diffusion.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the diffusion created at the bottom from the widening shafts of light. I''m wondering if there might be a way to increase some contrast overall without losing the diffusion.', '2010-08-21 14:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6136888, 903307, 115814, '<td valign="top">The almost perfect stillness of the reflections are disorienting (in a good way). The large concrete structure on the left presents an interesting balance to the other structures (especially considering that it''s reflection is less detailed than all the others. One of my favorites!</td>', 'The almost perfect stillness of the reflections are disorienting (in a good way). The large concrete structure on the left presents an interesting balance to the other structures (especially considering that it''s reflection is less detailed than all the others. One of my favorites!', '2010-08-21 14:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6136889, 904169, 115814, '<td valign="top">This is an intriguing shot of and intriguing structure. I''d love to have a better sense of what it looks like IRL. Nicely done, looking forward to reading some details after voting. Hope it does well.</td>', 'This is an intriguing shot of and intriguing structure. I''d love to have a better sense of what it looks like IRL. Nicely done, looking forward to reading some details after voting. Hope it does well.', '2010-08-21 14:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
