(6137868, 903894, 23484, '<td valign="top">Terry, this is such a great perspective. Outstanding.</td>', 'Terry, this is such a great perspective. Outstanding.', '2010-08-22 21:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137869, 903532, 23484, '<td valign="top">This makes an interesting diagonal.</td>', 'This makes an interesting diagonal.', '2010-08-22 21:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137871, 904162, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great idea to use the slow shutter speed to create motion blur. It adds interest to the photo. One drawback is that you gave up sharpness on the building. I am not sure if it is due to being handheld or not but it definitely hurt the sharpness. You can over come that by using a tripod, locking the mirror on the camera to avoid shake and also using a timed shutter release or a remote. As far as composition, I''d point the camera a little higher to get rid of the street in the foreground and get more of the building in.</td>', 'Great idea to use the slow shutter speed to create motion blur. It adds interest to the photo. One drawback is that you gave up sharpness on the building. I am not sure if it is due to being handheld or not but it definitely hurt the sharpness. You can over come that by using a tripod, locking the mirror on the camera to avoid shake and also using a timed shutter release or a remote. As far as composition, I''d point the camera a little higher to get rid of the street in the foreground and get more of the building in.', '2010-08-22 21:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137875, 903954, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice find and use of color to generate some pop. A few drawbacks in the image which are out of your control are the chain link fence and the power lines. Another element to add interest to the photo would be to photograph it with a great sky. Here with the white sky, it is somewhat boring. A blue sky would really make the orange pop more as it is a complimentary color. It would also take away some of the effect of the power lines.</td>', 'Nice find and use of color to generate some pop. A few drawbacks in the image which are out of your control are the chain link fence and the power lines. Another element to add interest to the photo would be to photograph it with a great sky. Here with the white sky, it is somewhat boring. A blue sky would really make the orange pop more as it is a complimentary color. It would also take away some of the effect of the power lines.', '2010-08-22 21:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137879, 904187, 10785, '<td valign="top">The image is good but it is really lacking in architectural content. I wouldn''t say it is DNMC, but it is not representative of architectural photography. It is more portrait photography.</td>', 'The image is good but it is really lacking in architectural content. I wouldn''t say it is DNMC, but it is not representative of architectural photography. It is more portrait photography.', '2010-08-22 21:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137909, 904137, 37845, '<td valign="top">Good luck jeger.. hope this has a great finish.</td>', 'Good luck jeger.. hope this has a great finish.', '2010-08-22 21:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137910, 903878, 37845, '<td valign="top">One of my favourits in this challenge. Great symmetry, great colour.</td>', 'One of my favourits in this challenge. Great symmetry, great colour.', '2010-08-22 21:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137911, 904061, 37845, '<td valign="top">This one just screams out ''golden ratio''. Great shot.</td>', 'This one just screams out ''golden ratio''. Great shot.', '2010-08-22 21:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137914, 904070, 37845, '<td valign="top">Such an immaculate building. I often take photos inside churches, but always wanted to photograph a mosgue... just wasnt sure if it was disrespectful to do so. Expect a PM from me after the challenge, I would love your advice on this.</td>', 'Such an immaculate building. I often take photos inside churches, but always wanted to photograph a mosgue... just wasnt sure if it was disrespectful to do so. Expect a PM from me after the challenge, I would love your advice on this.', '2010-08-22 21:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137917, 903449, 37845, '<td valign="top">Using the man in the red shirt was a brilliant move, it provides a great reference point for size and scale in this shot. Beautiful photo.</td>', 'Using the man in the red shirt was a brilliant move, it provides a great reference point for size and scale in this shot. Beautiful photo.', '2010-08-22 21:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137918, 903468, 37845, '<td valign="top">This awesome perspective makes this photo stand out. This is much better than having just the building.</td>', 'This awesome perspective makes this photo stand out. This is much better than having just the building.', '2010-08-22 21:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6137919, 904071, 37845, '<td valign="top">It looks like a very skinny, evil alien is staring me down :)  Very cool shot.</td>', 'It looks like a very skinny, evil alien is staring me down :)  Very cool shot.', '2010-08-22 21:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
