(6138824, 904185, 96997, '<td valign="top">Brilliant - one of the top photos in this challenge in my opinion - however, I don''t think everyone will agree.</td>', 'Brilliant - one of the top photos in this challenge in my opinion - however, I don''t think everyone will agree.', '2010-08-23 15:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
