(6140200, 903814, 115814, '<td valign="top">My 10th challenge is a good one for me  New PB  First entry over 6.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the positive comments - This is really an interesting piece of architecture. Part of a whole City Hall, Conference Center, Performing Arts Complex in Escondido, CA. Handheld looking straight up. Talk about a crick in the neck... I gotta use the tripod more :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-08-25 02:00:48.</i></td>', 'My 10th challenge is a good one for me  New PB  First entry over 6. Thanks for the positive comments - This is really an interesting piece of architecture. Part of a whole City Hall, Conference Center, Performing Arts Complex in Escondido, CA. Handheld looking straight up. Talk about a crick in the neck... I gotta use the tripod more :)', '2010-08-25 01:58:30.000000', '2010-08-25 03:00:48.000000', 0),
