(6140324, 903990, 86218, '<td valign="top">Very strong lines in this and good comp. The fact that this scored 5.5 in architecture when few would really see much of the theme in this is testimony to the elements working well together to make this work. Good shot</td>', 'Very strong lines in this and good comp. The fact that this scored 5.5 in architecture when few would really see much of the theme in this is testimony to the elements working well together to make this work. Good shot', '2010-08-25 04:03:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6140330, 903028, 87252, '<td valign="top">Hey not bad for a first entry man - I think people liked it but perhaps it didn''t meet the challenge in some people''s eyes. You have to try to be creative and obvious at the same time, this is maybe too subtle for the guys here! I really like the shot though. J</td>', 'Hey not bad for a first entry man - I think people liked it but perhaps it didn''t meet the challenge in some people''s eyes. You have to try to be creative and obvious at the same time, this is maybe too subtle for the guys here! I really like the shot though. J', '2010-08-25 04:18:45.000000', NULL, 0),
